{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"There is the water pressure, but it's not that bad. And...\" Roy swims a few circles around, staying fully submerged all the time. \"Yeah, pretty awesome.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T17:32:46.922000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880505066816163910","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
