{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"Scary. Like water pushes on you from all sides, you try to breathe, and the water just displaces all the air. Like it's gonna crush you.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T17:37:29.835000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880506253439291412","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"she nods, and goes to hug him, just floating through the water. 'I see... I remember hiding in the river one time. Before this. I felt a crushing sensation then, I suppose from the pressure... and the fear.'","created_at":"2021-08-26T17:39:50.388000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880506842961313802","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
