{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"People with clear desires, I suppose. Not boring ones like us who are fine with just some good food and a clear night sky to wonder under. Bah, I guess my job's getting to me. What happened to Roy, the mechanic, spending long hours under a roof taking engines apart?\" Roy shrugs. \"Though to be fair, I don't mind this change. I don't really have to give it up. Just add to it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T18:34:19.268000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880520553637757039","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"'Boring... I wouldn't call it that. I'd say... wanderers, looking to enjoy the beauty of nature, and going with the flow. Sounds more romantic that way.' she giggles slightly, and hops out of the pool, offering her hand to help him out.","created_at":"2021-08-26T18:36:36.407000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880521128840400956","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
